#: source/features/imitation-learning/humanoids_imitation.rst:222
msgid ""
"**If you don't see expected performance results:** It is critical to test "
"policies from various checkpoint epochs. Performance can vary significantly "
"between epochs, and the best-performing checkpoint is often not the final "
"one."
