#: source/features/imitation-learning/humanoids_imitation.rst:379
msgid ""
"Data generation for 1000 demonstrations takes approximately 10 hours on a "
"RTX ADA 6000."
msgstr "在 RTX ADA 6000 上生成 1000 个演示大约需要 10 小时。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/humanoids_imitation.rst:380
msgid ""
"Behavior Cloning (BC) policy success is typically 50-60% (evaluated on 50 "
"rollouts) when trained on 1000 generated demonstrations for 600 epochs "
"(default). Training takes approximately 15 hours on a RTX ADA 6000."
msgstr ""
"行为克隆（BC）策略成功率通常为 50-60%（在 50 次展示中评估），基于 1000 个生成的演示训练 600 个轮次（默认）。在 RTX ADA "
"6000 上训练大约需要 15 小时。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/humanoids_imitation.rst:381
msgid ""
"**Recommendation:** Train for 600 epochs with 1000 generated demonstrations,"
" and **evaluate multiple checkpoints saved between the 300th and 600th "
"epochs** to select the best-performing policy. Testing various epochs is "
"critical for achieving optimal performance."
msgstr ""
"**建议：** 使用 1000 个生成的演示训练 600 个轮次，并 **评估保存在第 300 到第 600 个轮次之间的多个检查点** "
"，以选择性能最佳的策略。测试不同轮次对于实现最优性能至关重要。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/humanoids_imitation.rst:385
msgid ""
"Demo 3: Data Generation and Policy Training for Humanoid Robot "
"Locomanipulation with Unitree G1"
msgstr "演示 3：Unitree G1 人形机器人移动操作的数据生成与策略训练"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/humanoids_imitation.rst:387
msgid ""
"In this demo, we showcase the integration of locomotion and manipulation "
"capabilities within a single humanoid robot system. This locomanipulation "
"environment enables data collection for complex tasks that combine "
"navigation and object manipulation. The demonstration follows a multi-step "
"process: first, it generates pick and place tasks similar to Demo 1, then "
"introduces a navigation component that uses specialized scripts to generate "
"scenes where the humanoid robot must move from point A to point B. The robot"
" picks up an object at the initial location (point A) and places it at the "
"target destination (point B)."
msgstr ""
"在本演示中，我们展示了在单个人形机器人系统中集成运动和操作能力。这个运动操作环境能够为结合导航和物体操作的复杂任务收集数据。演示遵循多步骤过程: "
"首先生成类似于演示 1 的拾取和放置任务，然后引入导航组件，使用专门的脚本生成场景，其中人形机器人必须从 A 点移动到 B 点。机器人在初始位置（A "
"点）拾取物体，并将其放置在目标位置（B 点）。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/humanoids_imitation.rst:393
msgid ""
"G1 humanoid robot with locomanipulation performing a pick and place task"
msgstr "具有运动操作能力的 G1 人形机器人执行拾取和放置任务"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/humanoids_imitation.rst:400
msgid "**Locomotion policy training**"
msgstr "**运动策略训练**"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/humanoids_imitation.rst:402
msgid ""
"The locomotion policy used in this integration example was trained using the"
" `AGILE <https://github.com/nvidia-isaac/WBC-AGILE>`__ framework. AGILE is "
"an officially supported humanoid control training pipeline that leverages "
"the manager based environment in Isaac Lab. It will also be seamlessly "
"integrated with other evaluation and deployment tools across Isaac products."
" This allows teams to rely on a single, maintained stack covering all "
"necessary infrastructure and tooling for policy training, with easy export "
"to real-world deployment. The AGILE repository contains updated pre-trained "
"policies with separate upper and lower body policies for flexibility. They "
"have been verified in the real world and can be directly deployed. Users can"
" also train their own locomotion or whole-body control policies using the "
"AGILE framework."
msgstr ""
"本集成示例使用的运动策略通过 `AGILE <https://github.com/nvidia-isaac/WBC-AGILE>`__ "
"框架训练。AGILE 是官方支持的人形机器人控制训练流水线，使用 Isaac Lab 基于管理器的环境，也将与 Isaac "
"产品中的其他评估及部署工具集成。团队可以依靠统一、持续维护的工具体系，获得策略训练所需的基础设施，并方便地导出到实机部署。AGILE "
"仓库包含更新的预训练策略，上半身和下半身策略分开，便于灵活使用。这些策略已通过实机验证，可直接部署。用户也可以通过 AGILE "
"训练自己的运动或全身控制策略。"

