"applied to the G1 humanoid robot with locomanipulation capabilities. This "
"demonstration shows how to train a G1 robot to perform pick and place tasks "
"with full-body locomotion and manipulation."
msgstr ""
"演示 1 的数据生成与策略训练步骤也可用于具备移动操作能力的 G1 人形机器人。本演示介绍如何训练 G1，结合全身移动与操作完成抓取放置任务。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/humanoids_imitation.rst:417
