msgstr "无障碍物的 G1 移动操作数据生成"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/humanoids_imitation.rst:566
msgid "Default: no obstacles (open scene)."
msgstr "默认配置：无障碍物（开放场景）。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/humanoids_imitation.rst:567
msgid "G1 locomanipulation data generation with forklift obstacles"
msgstr "包含叉车障碍物的 G1 移动操作数据生成"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/humanoids_imitation.rst:572
msgid "With 8 forklift obstacles and ``--randomize_placement`` enabled."
msgstr "包含 8 个叉车障碍物，并启用 ``--randomize_placement`` 。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/humanoids_imitation.rst:574
msgid ""
"The locomanipulation dataset generation process takes the previously "
"generated manipulation dataset and creates scenarios where the robot must "
"navigate from one location to another while performing manipulation tasks. "
"This creates a more complex dataset that includes both locomotion and "
"manipulation behaviors."
msgstr ""
"运动操作数据集生成过程采用先前生成的操作数据集，并创建机器人必须在执行操作任务的同时从一个位置导航到另一个位置的场景。这创建了一个更复杂的数据集，包括运动和操作行为。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/humanoids_imitation.rst:576
msgid "To generate the locomanipulation dataset, use the following command:"
msgstr "要生成运动操作数据集，请使用以下命令:"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/humanoids_imitation.rst:595
msgid ""
"The input dataset (``--dataset``) should be the manipulation dataset "
"generated in the previous step. You can specify any output filename using "
"the ``--output_file_name`` parameter."
msgstr ""
"输入数据集（ ``--dataset`` ）应该是上一步生成的操作数据集。您可以使用 ``--output_file_name`` "
"参数指定任何输出文件名。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/humanoids_imitation.rst:597
msgid "The key parameters for locomanipulation dataset generation are:"
msgstr "运动操作数据集生成的关键参数是:"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/humanoids_imitation.rst:599
msgid ""
"``--lift_step 60``: Number of steps for the lifting phase of the "
"manipulation task. This should mark the point immediately after the robot "
"has grasped the object."
msgstr "``--lift_step 60`` ：操作任务中抬升阶段的步数，应标记机器人刚抓住物体的时刻。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/humanoids_imitation.rst:600
msgid ""
"``--navigate_step 130``: Number of steps for the navigation phase between "
"locations. This should mark the point where the robot has lifted the object "
"and is ready to walk."
msgstr "``--navigate_step 130`` ：位置之间导航阶段的步数，应标记机器人已经抬起物体、准备行走的时刻。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/humanoids_imitation.rst:601
msgid "``--output_file``: Name of the output dataset file"
msgstr "``--output_file``: 输出数据集文件的名称"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/humanoids_imitation.rst:605
msgid ""
"You can change the number of obstacles (forklifts and boxes) in the scene by"
" editing the locomanipulation SDG environment configuration. In "
"``source/isaaclab_mimic/isaaclab_mimic/locomanipulation_sdg/envs/g1_locomanipulation_sdg_env.py``,"
" set the module-level constants ``NUM_FORKLIFTS`` and ``NUM_BOXES`` to the "
"desired counts. Use ``--randomize_placement`` when running "
":file:`generate_data.py` to randomize obstacle and fixture positions each "
"run."
msgstr ""
"可通过编辑移动操作 SDG 环境配置改变场景中的障碍物（叉车及箱子）数量。在 "
"``source/isaaclab_mimic/isaaclab_mimic/locomanipulation_sdg/envs/g1_locomanipulation_sdg_env.py``"
" 中，将模块级常量 ``NUM_FORKLIFTS`` 和 ``NUM_BOXES`` 设为所需数量。运行 "
":file:`generate_data.py` 时使用 ``--randomize_placement`` "
"，可在每次运行时随机化障碍物及固定设施的位置。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/humanoids_imitation.rst:607
msgid ""
"This process creates a dataset where the robot performs the manipulation "
"task at different locations, requiring it to navigate between points while "
"maintaining the learned manipulation behaviors. The resulting dataset can be"
" used to train policies that combine both locomotion and manipulation "
"capabilities."
msgstr ""
"此过程创建一个数据集，其中机器人在不同位置执行操作任务，需要在保持已学习的操作行为的同时在点之间导航。生成的数据集可用于训练结合运动和操作能力的策略。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/humanoids_imitation.rst:611
msgid ""
"You can visualize the robot trajectory results with the following script "
"command:"
msgstr "您可以使用以下脚本命令可视化机器人轨迹结果:"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/humanoids_imitation.rst:617
msgid ""
"The data generated from this locomanipulation pipeline can also be used to "
"finetune an imitation learning policy using GR00T N1.5. The following steps "
"describe how to install GR00T, convert the dataset to LeRobot format, "
"finetune the policy, and run rollouts in Isaac Lab."
msgstr ""
"此移动操作流水线生成的数据也可用于微调 GR00T N1.5 模仿学习策略。以下步骤介绍如何安装 GR00T、将数据集转换为 LeRobot "
"格式、微调策略，以及在 Isaac Lab 中运行策略轨迹。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/humanoids_imitation.rst:623
msgid "Finetune GR00T N1.5 policy for locomanipulation"
msgstr "微调用于移动操作的 GR00T N1.5 策略"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/humanoids_imitation.rst:625
msgid ""
"**Prerequisites:** Generate the locomanipulation dataset using the command "
"in the previous section (e.g. "
"``generated_dataset_g1_locomanipulation_sdg.hdf5``). The conversion step "
"accepts a directory of SDG HDF5 files, so you may group multiple "
"``generate_data.py`` outputs together — but the directory must contain "
"**only** SDG outputs, not other HDF5 files from earlier steps (e.g. "
"``dataset_annotated_g1_locomanip.hdf5`` or "
"``generated_dataset_g1_locomanip.hdf5``)."
msgstr ""
"**前提条件：** 使用上一节命令生成移动操作数据集，如 "
"``generated_dataset_g1_locomanipulation_sdg.hdf5`` 。转换步骤接受包含 SDG HDF5 "
"文件的目录，因此可将多个 ``generate_data.py`` 的输出放在一起；但目录中 **只能** 包含 SDG "
"输出，不能包含前面步骤产生的其他 HDF5 文件，如 ``dataset_annotated_g1_locomanip.hdf5`` 或 "
"``generated_dataset_g1_locomanip.hdf5`` 。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/humanoids_imitation.rst:629
msgid "Install GR00T in a separate environment (uv)"
msgstr "在独立环境中安装 GR00T（uv）"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/humanoids_imitation.rst:631
msgid ""
"GR00T N1.5 and Isaac Lab require incompatible NumPy and Transformers "
"versions. Keep the simulator in the Isaac Lab environment and run "
"conversion, training, and policy serving in a separate GR00T environment. "
"Rollout communicates with the policy server over localhost."
msgstr ""
"GR00T N1.5 与 Isaac Lab 要求的 NumPy 和 Transformers 版本不兼容。仿真器应留在 Isaac Lab "
"环境中，数据转换、训练和策略服务则在独立的 GR00T 环境中运行。策略执行过程通过 localhost 与策略服务器通信。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/humanoids_imitation.rst:635
msgid ""
"Start from the **IsaacLab repository root**. The following commands create a"
" sibling GR00T checkout and save absolute paths for the later steps. Keep "
"these variables in the shell, or set them again when opening a new terminal:"
msgstr ""
"从 **IsaacLab 仓库根目录** 开始。以下命令在相邻目录中克隆 GR00T，并保存后续步骤需要的绝对路径。请在当前 shell "
"中保留这些变量；打开新终端时，需要重新设置："

#: source/features/imitation-learning/humanoids_imitation.rst:648
msgid ""
"This revision is the N1.5 version used by this workflow. Copy the G1 "
"configuration and apply the supplied PyTorch SDPA patch once to this fresh "
"checkout:"
msgstr "该提交是本工作流程使用的 N1.5 版本。向这个新克隆的仓库复制 G1 配置，并应用一次随附的 PyTorch SDPA 补丁："

#: source/features/imitation-learning/humanoids_imitation.rst:656
msgid ""
"Create the separate Python 3.12 environment. The commands below use the CUDA"
" 12.8 PyTorch wheels on Linux x86_64. Other platforms require matching "
"PyTorch and Torchvision builds for their hardware. The SDPA patch avoids a "
"separate flash-attn build."
msgstr ""
"创建独立的 Python 3.12 环境。下面的命令适用于 Linux x86_64，使用 CUDA 12.8 的 PyTorch "
"wheel。其他平台需要选择与硬件匹配的 PyTorch 和 Torchvision 构建。SDPA 补丁可以避免单独编译 flash-attn。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/humanoids_imitation.rst:672
msgid ""
"The ``decord2`` distribution retains the ``decord`` Python import used by "
"GR00T and provides pre-built wheels for both x86_64 and aarch64 systems, "
"including DGX Spark."
msgstr ""
"``decord2`` 发行包保留了 GR00T 使用的 ``decord`` Python 导入名，并为 x86_64 和 aarch64 系统（包括"
" DGX Spark）提供预编译 wheel。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/humanoids_imitation.rst:677
msgid ""
"Every GR00T install command specifies both ``--no-config`` and ``--python``."
" This prevents Isaac Lab's NumPy override from replacing GR00T's pin even "
"when installing from the Isaac Lab checkout, and avoids modifying the "
"simulator environment. The requirements also pin Diffusers and Hugging Face "
"Hub together to preserve Transformers compatibility. Use the same "
"requirements as constraints when adding packages to this environment."
msgstr ""
"每条 GR00T 安装命令均明确指定 ``--no-config`` 和 ``--python``。即使在 Isaac Lab 工作副本中安装，也能防止"
" Isaac Lab 的 NumPy 覆盖配置替换 GR00T 固定的版本，同时避免修改仿真器环境。依赖文件还配套固定了 Diffusers 和 "
"Hugging Face Hub 的版本，以保持与 Transformers 兼容。向此环境添加软件包时，应继续使用同一份依赖文件作为版本约束。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/humanoids_imitation.rst:683
msgid ""
"Run GR00T commands with ``uv run --no-project --python \"$GR00T_PYTHON\"`` "
"as shown below. ``--no-sync`` alone does not select the GR00T interpreter or"
" bypass install-time overrides. If an earlier shared installation changed "
"Isaac Lab's dependencies, restore that environment with ``uv sync --extra "
"isaacsim --extra mimic`` before rollout."
msgstr ""
"按下文示例使用 ``uv run --no-project --python \"$GR00T_PYTHON\"`` 运行 GR00T 命令。仅使用 "
"``--no-sync`` 不会选择 GR00T 解释器，也不会绕过安装时的覆盖配置。如果此前共用环境的安装方式修改了 Isaac Lab "
"的依赖，应先用 ``uv sync --extra isaacsim --extra mimic`` 恢复环境，再执行策略。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/humanoids_imitation.rst:688
msgid ""
"The compiled PyTorch3D extension is intentionally disabled here because "
"GR00T N1.5 uses only ``pytorch3d.transforms``. This avoids compiling unused "
"CUDA renderers and supports systems where the extension cannot be linked, "
"including aarch64 Blackwell systems."
msgstr ""
"这里有意禁用了 PyTorch3D 的编译扩展，因为 GR00T N1.5 只使用 ``pytorch3d.transforms`` "
"。这样可以避免编译未使用的 CUDA 渲染器，也能支持无法链接该扩展的系统，包括 aarch64 Blackwell 系统。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/humanoids_imitation.rst:693
msgid "Convert dataset to LeRobot format"
msgstr "将数据集转换为 LeRobot 格式"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/humanoids_imitation.rst:695
msgid ""
"GR00T N1.5 expects data in LeRobot format. From the **IsaacLab** repository "
"root, run the conversion script. ``<input_dir>`` is a directory containing "
"one or more SDG ``.hdf5`` files produced by ``generate_data.py`` (and **no "
"other HDF5 files**). ``<output_path>`` is the LeRobot-format output "
"directory (e.g. ``./datasets/datasets_train_200_lerobot``). Episodes with "
"very low object displacement are skipped."
msgstr ""
"GR00T N1.5 要求 LeRobot 格式的数据。请在 **IsaacLab** 仓库根目录运行转换脚本。 ``<input_dir>`` "
"是包含一个或多个由 ``generate_data.py`` 生成的 SDG ``.hdf5`` 文件的目录，且 **不能有其他 HDF5 文件** 。"
" ``<output_path>`` 是 LeRobot 格式的输出目录，如 "
"``./datasets/datasets_train_200_lerobot`` 。物体位移过小的回合会被跳过。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/humanoids_imitation.rst:702
msgid ""
"Example — move the SDG output into its own directory first so the converter "
"only sees SDG files:"
msgstr "例如，先将 SDG 输出移到专用目录，确保转换器只读取 SDG 文件："

#: source/features/imitation-learning/humanoids_imitation.rst:712
msgid "Finetune the policy"
msgstr "微调策略"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/humanoids_imitation.rst:714
msgid ""
"Run finetuning from the **Isaac-GR00T** repository root. Use the LeRobot-"
"format output path from the previous step as ``--dataset-path`` and choose "
"an ``--output-dir`` for checkpoints. The ``--data-config "
"g1_locomanipulation_sdg`` and ``--embodiment-tag new_embodiment`` options "
"are required for the G1 locomanipulation task."
msgstr ""
"在 **Isaac-GR00T** 仓库根目录运行微调。将上一步的 LeRobot 格式输出路径用作 ``--dataset-path`` ，并通过 "
"``--output-dir`` 指定检查点目录。G1 移动操作任务必须使用 ``--data-config "
"g1_locomanipulation_sdg`` 和 ``--embodiment-tag new_embodiment`` 。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/humanoids_imitation.rst:730
msgid ""
"See the GR00T N1.5 repository documentation for additional training options."
msgstr "更多训练选项见 GR00T N1.5 仓库文档。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/humanoids_imitation.rst:734
msgid ""
"**Skip finetuning:** A pre-trained GR00T N1.5 checkpoint for this task is "
"available on Hugging Face at `nvidia/g1_locomanip_finetune "
"<https://huggingface.co/nvidia/g1_locomanip_finetune>`__. Downloading it "
"lets you skip the finetuning step and proceed directly to rollout."
msgstr ""
"**跳过微调：** Hugging Face 上的 `nvidia/g1_locomanip_finetune "
"<https://huggingface.co/nvidia/g1_locomanip_finetune>`__ 提供了本任务的 GR00T N1.5 "
"预训练检查点。下载后可跳过微调，直接运行策略轨迹。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/humanoids_imitation.rst:738
msgid "Download and unzip the checkpoint:"
msgstr "下载并解压检查点："

#: source/features/imitation-learning/humanoids_imitation.rst:745
msgid ""
"The archive extracts to "
"``./checkpoints/g1_locomanip_finetune_20260129_231610/``. Use "
"``./checkpoints/g1_locomanip_finetune_20260129_231610/checkpoint-20000`` as "
"the ``--model_path`` in the server command below. This checkpoint requires "
"``--policy_quat_format wxyz`` on the rollout client."
msgstr ""
"压缩包解压到 ``./checkpoints/g1_locomanip_finetune_20260129_231610/``。在下方服务器命令中，将 "
"``--model_path`` 设为 "
"``./checkpoints/g1_locomanip_finetune_20260129_231610/checkpoint-20000``。此检查点要求策略执行客户端设置"
" ``--policy_quat_format wxyz``。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/humanoids_imitation.rst:750
msgid "Rollout the policy in Isaac Lab"
msgstr "在 Isaac Lab 中运行策略轨迹"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/humanoids_imitation.rst:752
msgid ""
"Start the policy server in the **GR00T environment**, supplying an absolute "
"path to your finetuned checkpoint. Wait for ``Server is ready and "
"listening`` before starting rollout:"
msgstr ""
"在 **GR00T 环境** 中启动策略服务器，并提供微调后检查点的绝对路径。等待出现 ``Server is ready and "
"listening`` 后，再开始执行策略："

#: source/features/imitation-learning/humanoids_imitation.rst:761
msgid ""
"In a **second terminal**, from the **IsaacLab repository root**, run the "
"simulator with the static manipulation dataset (used for scene/demo setup) "
"and the task name. The two ``--with`` options supply only the lightweight "
"messaging dependencies; the simulator does not import GR00T, Transformers, "
"or GR00T's dataset schema through the policy client:"
msgstr ""
"在 **第二个终端** 中，从 **IsaacLab 仓库根目录** 运行仿真器，指定用于场景和演示初始化的静态操作数据集及任务名称。两个 "
"``--with`` 选项仅提供轻量级通信依赖；仿真器不会通过策略客户端导入 GR00T、Transformers 或 GR00T 的数据集 "
"schema："

#: source/features/imitation-learning/humanoids_imitation.rst:778
msgid ""
"Optional arguments include ``--randomize_placement`` and "
"``--policy_quat_format wxyz`` (use if your checkpoint was trained with wxyz "
"quaternion format). Use ``--max_steps 32`` for a bounded smoke run. "
"``--policy_port`` defaults to 5555 and ``--policy_timeout_ms`` defaults to "
"15000. A timeout raises an error instead of hanging the simulator. Stop the "
"server with Ctrl-C when finished. It binds to localhost by default; its "
"protocol is intended for a trusted local connection."
msgstr ""
"可选参数包括 ``--randomize_placement`` 和 ``--policy_quat_format wxyz``；检查点以 wxyz "
"四元数格式训练时，应使用后者。可用 ``--max_steps 32`` 进行有限步数的试运行。``--policy_port`` 默认为 "
"5555，``--policy_timeout_ms`` 默认为 15000。超时会抛出错误，避免仿真器一直等待。完成后用 Ctrl-C "
"停止服务器。服务器默认绑定 localhost，其协议用于可信的本地连接。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/humanoids_imitation.rst:784
msgid ""
"The legacy ``--model_path`` rollout option remains available for custom "
"compatible environments, but the standard Isaac Lab environment requires the"
" server/client workflow."
msgstr ""
"旧版策略执行选项 ``--model_path`` 仍可用于自定义的兼容环境，但标准 Isaac Lab 环境需要采用服务器/客户端工作流程。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/humanoids_imitation.rst:787
msgid "Simulation rollout of GR00T N1.5 policy finetuned for locomanipulation"
msgstr "针对运动操作微调的 GR00T N1.5 策略的模拟展示"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/humanoids_imitation.rst:793
msgid ""
"Simulation rollout of GR00T N1.5 policy finetuned for locomanipulation."
msgstr "针对运动操作微调的 GR00T N1.5 策略的模拟展示。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/humanoids_imitation.rst:795
msgid ""
"The policy shown above uses the camera image, hand poses, hand joint "
"positions, object pose, and base goal pose as inputs. The output of the "
"model is the target base velocity, hand poses, and hand joint positions for "
"the next several timesteps."
msgstr ""
"上面显示的策略使用相机图像、手部姿态、手部关节位置、物体姿态和基础目标姿态作为输入。模型的输出是接下来几个时间步的目标基础速度、手部姿态和手部关节位置。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/humanoids_imitation.rst:799
msgid "Integrating 3D Gaussian Splatting into SDG"
msgstr "将 3D 高斯泼溅集成到 SDG"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/humanoids_imitation.rst:801
msgid ""
"This section extends :ref:`locomanipulation SDG <generate-the-dataset-with-"
"manipulation-and-point-to-point-navigation>` by replacing the synthetic "
"background with a 3D Gaussian Splatting (NuRec) scene. The workflow takes a "
"manipulation dataset as input and produces a combined navigation and "
"manipulation dataset as an HDF5 file. The navigation replay happens in a "
"neurally-reconstructed environment, and an ego-centric camera captures the "
"result, producing more realistic training data. For more info on NuRec "
"rendering in Isaac Sim, see `Neural Volume Rendering "
"<https://docs.isaacsim.omniverse.nvidia.com/latest/assets/usd_assets_nurec.html>`__"
" for details."
msgstr ""
"本节扩展 :ref:`移动操作 SDG <generate-the-dataset-with-manipulation-and-point-to-"
"point-navigation>` ，用 3D 高斯泼溅（NuRec）场景替换合成背景。工作流以操作数据集为输入，生成包含导航与操作的 HDF5 "
"数据集。导航在神经重建环境中回放，由第一视角相机采集结果，得到更逼真的训练数据。Isaac Sim 中 NuRec 渲染的更多信息，见 `神经体渲染 "
"<https://docs.isaacsim.omniverse.nvidia.com/latest/assets/usd_assets_nurec.html>`__"
" 。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/humanoids_imitation.rst:813
msgid ""
"This section focuses on data generation with a 3DGS background. To train a "
"policy on the generated data, see :ref:`Finetune GR00T N1.5 policy for "
"locomanipulation <finetune-groot-n15-for-locomanipulation>`."
msgstr ""
"本节介绍带 3DGS 背景的数据生成。使用生成数据训练策略的方法，见 :ref:`微调用于移动操作的 GR00T N1.5 策略 <finetune-"
"groot-n15-for-locomanipulation>` 。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/humanoids_imitation.rst:818
msgid ""
"The locomanipulation SDG pipeline currently runs a single environment. "
"Parallel environment support is not yet available for this workflow."
msgstr "移动操作 SDG 流水线目前只运行单个环境，尚不支持并行环境。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/humanoids_imitation.rst:822
msgid "Setup: downloading example assets"
msgstr "准备：下载示例资产"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/humanoids_imitation.rst:824
msgid ""
"We provide a sample asset, ``hand_hold-voyager-babyboom``, on `Hugging Face "
"<https://huggingface.co/datasets/nvidia/PhysicalAI-Robotics-"
"NuRec/tree/main>`__."
msgstr ""
"我们在 `Hugging Face <https://huggingface.co/datasets/nvidia/PhysicalAI-"
"Robotics-NuRec/tree/main>`__ 提供示例资产 ``hand_hold-voyager-babyboom`` 。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/humanoids_imitation.rst:827
msgid "Log in to Hugging Face:"
msgstr "登录 Hugging Face："

#: source/features/imitation-learning/humanoids_imitation.rst:833
msgid "Download the required USDZ stage file and occupancy maps:"
msgstr "下载所需的 USDZ 舞台文件及占据地图："

#: source/features/imitation-learning/humanoids_imitation.rst:845
msgid "Asset requirements"
msgstr "资产要求"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/humanoids_imitation.rst:847
msgid ""
"If you are using custom 3D Gaussian assets, ensure they meet these "
"specifications to be compatible with the SDG pipeline:"
msgstr "自定义 3D 高斯资产需满足以下要求，才能兼容 SDG 流水线："

#: source/features/imitation-learning/humanoids_imitation.rst:850
msgid ""
"The scene has sufficient free space (e.g. 5m x 5m) for asset placement and "
"robot navigation."
msgstr "场景留有足够的自由空间（如 5 m × 5 m），用于放置资产和机器人导航。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/humanoids_imitation.rst:851
msgid ""
"The ground surface is aligned with the z=0 plane, as the pipeline assumes "
"this elevation for object placement."
msgstr "地面与 z=0 平面对齐，因为流水线按这一高度放置物体。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/humanoids_imitation.rst:853
msgid "An occupancy map is required for path planning."
msgstr "提供用于路径规划的占据地图。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/humanoids_imitation.rst:856
msgid "Generating the dataset"
msgstr "生成数据集"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/humanoids_imitation.rst:858
msgid ""
"Before proceeding, ensure you have generated a manipulation dataset or "
"downloaded the sample dataset provided in the :ref:`Generate the "
"manipulation dataset <generate-the-manipulation-dataset>` section."
msgstr ""
"继续之前，请确保已生成操作数据集，或下载 :ref:`生成操作数据集 <generate-the-manipulation-dataset>` "
"一节提供的示例数据集。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/humanoids_imitation.rst:862
msgid ""
"At runtime, the script adds a ground plane at ``z=0`` to the scene. It then "
"proceeds through four stages:"
msgstr "运行时，脚本会在场景的 ``z=0`` 处添加地面，然后执行四个阶段："

#: source/features/imitation-learning/humanoids_imitation.rst:865
msgid ""
"**Pick**: The robot picks up an object at the start location by replaying "
"the manipulation trajectory. ``--lift_step`` marks the end of this stage "
"(immediately after grasp)."
msgstr "**抓取** ：机器人回放操作轨迹，在起始位置抓起物体。 ``--lift_step`` 标记此阶段的结束，即刚完成抓取的时刻。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/humanoids_imitation.rst:867
msgid ""
"**Navigate**: The robot travels to the target location using occupancy-map "
"path planning and its locomotion policy. ``--navigate_step`` marks the end "
"of this stage (when the robot is in place to release the object)."
msgstr ""
"**导航** ：机器人利用占据地图进行路径规划，并通过运动策略前往目标位置。 ``--navigate_step`` "
"标记此阶段的结束，即机器人已到位、准备放下物体的时刻。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/humanoids_imitation.rst:870
msgid ""
"**Place**: The robot places the object at the target location, completing "
"the trajectory."
msgstr "**放置** ：机器人在目标位置放下物体，完成轨迹。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/humanoids_imitation.rst:871
msgid ""
"**Record**: Joint states, poses, and the ego-centric video are saved to the "
"HDF5 file specified by ``--output_file``."
msgstr "**记录** ：将关节状态、位姿及第一视角视频保存到 ``--output_file`` 指定的 HDF5 文件。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/humanoids_imitation.rst:874
msgid "Run the generation command:"
msgstr "运行生成命令："

#: source/features/imitation-learning/humanoids_imitation.rst:891
msgid ""
"To inspect the run in the GUI, add ``--viz kit``; adjust the perspective "
"camera, or switch the viewport to the robot camera view for clearer "
"visualization."
msgstr "要在图形界面中查看运行情况，添加 ``--viz kit`` ；可调整透视相机，或将视口切换为机器人相机视图，以便更清楚地观察。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/humanoids_imitation.rst:894
msgid "The key parameters are:"
msgstr "主要参数如下："

#: source/features/imitation-learning/humanoids_imitation.rst:896
msgid "``--background_usd_path``: Path to the 3D Gaussian NuRec USD asset."
msgstr "``--background_usd_path`` ：3D 高斯 NuRec USD 资产的路径。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/humanoids_imitation.rst:897
msgid ""
"``--background_occupancy_yaml_file``: Path to the NuRec occupancy map file."
msgstr "``--background_occupancy_yaml_file`` ：NuRec 占据地图文件的路径。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/humanoids_imitation.rst:898
msgid ""
"Placement randomization is enabled automatically when a NuRec scene is used."
msgstr "使用 NuRec 场景时，会自动启用放置位置随机化。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/humanoids_imitation.rst:899
msgid ""
"``--high_res_video``: Capture the ego-centric camera at 512×320 instead of "
"the default 256×160."
msgstr "``--high_res_video`` ：以 512×320 分辨率采集第一视角相机画面，替代默认的 256×160。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/humanoids_imitation.rst:902
msgid ""
"When the run completes successfully, an HDF5 dataset is generated containing"
" camera observations. Install FFmpeg-enabled OpenCV, then convert the ego-"
"centric camera view to MP4:"
msgstr "运行成功后，会生成包含相机观测的 HDF5 数据集。安装支持 FFmpeg 的 OpenCV，再将第一视角相机画面转换为 MP4："

#: source/features/imitation-learning/humanoids_imitation.rst:916
msgid ""
"Set ``--video_width`` and ``--video_height`` to match the resolution "
"captured during generation: 512×320 with ``--high_res_video``, or 256×160 "
"without it."
msgstr ""
"将 ``--video_width`` 和 ``--video_height`` 设为数据生成时的分辨率：使用 ``--high_res_video``"
" 时为 512×320，否则为 256×160。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/humanoids_imitation.rst:919
msgid "locomanipulation SDG with a 3D Gaussian background"
msgstr "带 3D 高斯背景的移动操作 SDG"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/humanoids_imitation.rst:925
msgid ""
"The figure above shows recorded ego-centric camera views in the 3D Gaussian "
"background when the robot replays the pick and place trajectory and "
"navigates to the target location."
msgstr "上图展示了机器人在 3D 高斯背景中回放抓取放置轨迹并导航到目标位置时，录制的第一视角相机画面。"
